tage during performances.\n  - Frank Ocean tour: Calvin met Frank Ocean at a Tokyo music festival; they spoke, shared ideas, met again, and recorded a song in the studio at Calvin's mansion.\n  - everything: Calvin is currently on tour with Frank Ocean, finding the performances energizing but acknowledging that fame presents challenges in balancing his job and personal life.\n  - details: Dave wants Calvin to share details about meeting Frank Ocean, recording a song, and future plans when Calvin is available.\n  - city: Calvin performed in Tokyo, met Frank Ocean, and asked Dave about the city in a sunset photo. The photo was taken near a clock tower.\n  - Frank Ocean: Calvin is on tour with Frank Ocean. Calvin finds the tour awesome but occasionally overwhelming due to many demands, yet pushes on.\n  - food: Calvin is touring with Frank Ocean and enjoying amazing crowd energy. He is excited to explore Tokyo, specifically Shibuya Crossing and Shinjuku, and try the amazing food there.\n  - podcast: Calvin recorded a podcast following a studio session with Frank Ocean in Tokyo; Dave is excited to hear it when it's uploaded.\n  - the tour: Calvin is touring with Frank Ocean, finding the performance energizing with great crowd connection. He acknowledges fame presents challenges in balancing his job and personal life.\n  - studio: Calvin's music studio was complimented by Dave. Calvin recorded a song with Frank Ocean there after meeting at a Tokyo music festival; it also has a cozy relaxation room.\n  - concerts: Calvin is touring with Frank Ocean and values concerts for the connection between artist and crowd. Calvin watches concerts for inspiration and industry learning.\n  - music scene: Calvin toured with Frank Ocean, finding the Tokyo crowd insane. He is excited about the music scene and Dave will cheer him on in Boston.\n  - Performing live: Calvin toured with Frank Ocean, finding performing live in Tokyo wild, incredible, and an indescribable high that fuels his s