les and bought a third one for a large tank.\n  - picture: Nate complimented Joanna's drawings, asking what inspired them. Joanna previously mentioned seeing her writing acted out and Nate complimented a hiking picture.\n  - stuffed animal: Joanna has a stuffed animal dog named Tilly, which Nate gave her. Tilly stays with Joanna while she writes and brings her joy, helping her stay focused.\n  - storytelling: Nate likes a trilogy for its world building, battles, and storytelling, which he finds amazing.\n  - Nate: Nate is an assistant who recently added a new family member named Max. He is communicating with Joanna about his busy week and Max.\n  - Max: Nate took Max for a walk and met a nearby couple; they arranged doggy playdates, and Max likes the other dog, which Nate anticipates will be a great walking buddy.\n  - buddies: Nate referred to his little dudes as his buddies, noting they are calm and peaceful companions who enjoy their new, expanded tank.\n  - Nate: Nate went to a game convention last Friday, met new people, and planned a gaming session with new friends who share his interests. Nate previously won a big video game tournament, earning money he plans to save.\n  - game convention: Nate attended a game convention last Friday, met new people, and planned a gaming session with new friends who share his interests.\n  - recipes: Joanna will bring some of her recipes to share desserts with Nate.\n  - desserts: Joanna will bring some of her dessert recipes to share with Nate, building on a prior conversation where they discussed dairy-free dessert recipes.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie from her road-trip script, asked about the coolest on-set moment, and commented that her food looked yummy with nice colors and kick.\n  - keepsakes: Joanna shared a picture of her cork board, which contains quotes, photos, and little keepsakes.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie from the road-trip script and asked about the 