 date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Jolene is asking Deb for advice concerning studying and time management. (event_time: 2023-03-02T19:18:00Z)\n  - Deborah suggested that Jolene try 'it' (likely the Pomodoro Technique or a time management strategy) to help Jolene stay focused and less stressed. (event_time: 2023-03-22T17:35:00Z)\n  - Jolene is asking for tips regarding time management. (event_time: 2023-03-02T19:18:00Z)\n  - Jolene is asking for tips regarding studies. (event_time: 2023-03-02T19:18:00Z)\n  - Jolene asked Deborah for tips on maintaining a balance between hobbies and studies. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Jolene asked Deborah for tips on maintaining a balance between hobbies and studies. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Jolene asked Deborah for tips on maintaining a balance between hobbies and studies. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - The Pomodoro Technique is being used by Jolene as a method related to time management. (event_time: 2023-03-22T17:35:00Z)\n  - Jolene mentioned that she and Deb are doing something together. (event_time: 2023-09-12T14:18:00Z)\n  - Deborah offers to tell Jolene about it (the time management technique) (event_time: 2023-03-22T17:35:00Z)\n  - Time management tips include breaking tasks into smaller pieces and setting goals for Deborah (event_time: 2023-03-02T19:18:00Z)\n  - Deborah advises Jolene to make time for things that bring you joy. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - Deborah advises Jolene to reach for her goals. (event_time: 2023-08-24T09:34:00Z)\n  - Jolene told Deb to take care. (event_time: 2023-01-27T09:49:00Z)\n  - Deborah expressed gladness that the previous advice was helpful to Jolene. (event_time: 2023-03-22T17:35:00Z)\n  - Deborah suggests making a schedule and setting aside specific time for studyin