rst professional website project for a local small business and is currently playing AC Valhalla.\n  - John: John started playing the board game \"Dungeons of the Dragon\". Previously, John volunteered programming skills for a charitable foundation and got his dream job.\n  - John: John started playing board games, trying \"Dungeons of the Dragon.\" He enjoys electronic and rock music and used to play drums. He left his 3-year IT job for a new one aligned with his values.\n  - John: John collaborated with a game developer on an online board game and appreciates dogs for the joy and positivity they bring.\n  - John: John is experiencing a mix of emotions, feeling determined and passionate, yet overwhelmed and stressed due to balancing personal and professional life.\n  - John: John started a startup making portable smokers, welding one prototype. He is launching a 2D adventure game soon and recently held a Fortnite gaming tourney to raise funds for a children's hospital.\n  - John: John started a new startup yesterday focusing on portable smokers and has already welded one from metal.\n  - John: John met three new friends in his programming course last Tuesday and expressed a dream of visiting Italy, while congratulating James on adopting a pup named Ned.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2147,"context_chars":8525,"retrieval_duration":0.21407794952392578,"response_duration":3.438840389251709,"total_duration":3.6529183387756348,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer touches on the immersive aspect of the game and mentions the importance of choices, which aligns with the gold answer about shaping the world.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides sufficient information to answer the question about what aspect of 'The Witcher 3' John finds immersive. Specifically, it states that 'with The Witcher 3, players like James can shape the world with choices and feel the impact,' which directly aligns with the golden answer r