pt, making Joanna excited and giving her chills.\n  - a hard moment in my life: Joanna wrote an online blog post about 'a hard moment in my life'; someone later wrote her a letter saying the story brought them comfort.\n  - recommendation: Joanna noted that it is nice when a friend's recommendation fits one's taste well.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1913,"context_chars":7568,"retrieval_duration":0.239973783493042,"response_duration":3.6305437088012695,"total_duration":3.8705174922943115,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer specifies a date (September 7, 2022) that falls within the week before September 14, 2022, thus addressing the same time period as the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides specific information about Joanna's laptop crash, stating that it occurred 'last week' and includes the event time of September 7, 2022. This aligns perfectly with the golden answer, which indicates that the crash happened the week before September 14, 2022. Therefore, all necessary details to answer the question are present in the context.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Joanna's laptop crashed last week","event_time: 2022-09-07T00:00:00Z"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_7","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_7_qa_127","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"Who are the musicians mentioned by Jolene that she enjoys listening to during her yoga practice?","golden_answer":"Nils Frahm and Olafur Arnalds","hypothesis":"Jolene enjoys listening to Nils Frahm and Olafur Arnalds during her yoga practice.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated