lements":[],"present_elements":["Gina made a limited edition line","The limited edition line includes a hoodie"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_5","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_5_qa_53","category":"3","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What is a career that Andrew could potentially pursue with his love for animals and nature?","golden_answer":"Park ranger or a similar position working for the National Park Services.","hypothesis":"Given Andrew's love for animals and nature, a potential career he could pursue is in wildlife conservation or animal care. This could involve working as a wildlife biologist, animal behaviorist, or in roles related to environmental education and advocacy. His interest in volunteering with animals and his appreciation for nature suggest he would thrive in a career that allows him to work closely with animals and promote the importance of preserving natural habitats. Additionally, roles in animal shelters or rescue organizations could align well with his passion for helping animals.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Andrew loves animals. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Andrew is interested in everything nature has to offer. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew is looking forward to exploring nature more. (event_time: 2023-06-26T13:51:00Z)\n  - Andrew wants to stay close to nature (event_time: 2023-05-06T10:47:00Z)\n  - Andrew intends to try those activities with his pups. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew intends to