hs since that adoption. \n\nTo calculate:\n- From July 11, 2023, to November 11, 2023, is 4 months.\n- Since it is now late November 2023, it has been a little over 4 months since Andrew adopted Toby. \n\nTherefore, the answer is: Approximately 4 months.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Andrew has been looking for a doggo to adopt since the last time Andrew and the assistant spoke. (event_time: 2023-05-06T10:47:00Z)\n  - Andrew recently adopted a pup from a pet shelter. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew adopted another dog (referred to as doggo) recently. (event_time: 2023-11-22T00:00:00Z)\n  - Andrew adopted a doggo, which is now one of their dogs. (event_time: 2023-11-22T00:00:00Z)\n  - Andrew recently acquired a puppy named Toby. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew has been visiting shelters while looking for a doggo to adopt. (event_time: 2023-05-06T10:47:00Z)\n  - Audrey adopted another puppy named Pixie as a surprise for Andrew. (event_time: 2023-04-02T14:42:00Z)\n  - Audrey asks about the condition of the pup Andrew recently adopted in its new home. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew loves animals. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Audrey asks Andrew how the newly adopted pup is doing. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew has many furry friends. (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Toby is Andrew's pet/companion. (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Andrew has been asking friends about adopting a doggo. (event_time: 2023-05-06T10:47:0